    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>CryptPad includes a Markdown-based presentation tool. You write your presentation as text and the tool lays it out into slides.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Start a presentation",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Click <strong>+</strong> and select <strong>Slide</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a053f62be8cb42ea.webp",
              "width": 1450,
              "height": 1252
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Write and present slides",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Write your slides as text on the left. Separate slides with <code>---</code>. Click <strong>Present</strong> to enter fullscreen mode, and navigate slides with the arrow keys.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/82ccb028d62e5ce2.webp",
              "width": 1825,
              "height": 1131
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Other file formats",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<p>CryptPad doesn't support real-time browser editing of formats such as PowerPoint, but you can share those files on CryptDrive and edit and present them locally.</p>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    }
